  "suite_sha256": "18a491178c030cacae10edb6899007662fa4df411fac26b9b0633c2545d8144b",
  "rationale": "These cases target boundary behaviors not fully covered in the existing suite: exact matching of tenant/key casing, retrying a failed key after insufficient stock, release visibility across tenants, original payload binding under same key with different sku/qty attempts, invalid type and enum handling without state changes, and repeated release restoring stock only once. Each scenario starts fresh and includes stock checks to expose silent state mutations.",
